## Stage 1 follow-up (by hand, after the script stopped): operator recovery of the zero-UUID cluster

The script stage above ended with pwrrecover/pwrb3 failed (script defect: node_vm was empty with the services at 0, and the product answered 409 for the first seconds after the services were stopped). Below: the diagnosis once the health of the stopped nodes had refreshed, wsrep-recover per node and the manual bootstrap (transcript of the helper scripts; status lines of manual.sh are errors of its status helper, st.sh shows the state).

